<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Bank says to cut work force by 1,500.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Bank says to cut work force by 1,500.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sumitomo Bank Ltd plans to cut its work force by 1,500 from 16,455 by the end of March, 1999, a senior bank official told a news conference on Friday.  </p>
<p>The official said Sumitomo had cut its work force by 1,255 over the three-year period to March 1995.</p>
